ndered_turn_sha256":"f7834e51e76e50edfc2b013b334d0e85fae82ee0b65757eeaca85e284368da4b","session_date":"2023-10-15","session_datetime":"2023-10-15T09:39:00","session_id":"session_23","session_index":23,"source_sha256":"df7c2177982afc61a478d0a0dcf934cf7b68c0e2766fee9fc08bac06e3c17f43","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":18}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- The 2023-10-15 conversation continued: Dave said The Fireworks headlined the festival (answering Calvin's question); Calvin: \"Wow, I heard great things about The Fireworks! Performing with Frank Ocean recently has been really cool. Seeing them perform live must've been awesome - I bet the energy was electric. That's why I love my job so much - connecting with the crowd.\" (Calvin's \"recently\" — the Frank Ocean tour he described to Dave on 2023-08-14 as having ended with the Tokyo show — suggests more recent performances with Frank Ocean; not confirmed) [S23T9][S23T10]. Dave: \"The crowd had such a buzz. Music brings people together in such an amazing way, and it's just like when I'm fixing up things. I love the feeling of taking something broken and making it whole again. That's why I keep doing what I do.\" Calvin: \"Music and repairing things are so fulfilling and satisfying. Seeing something go from broken to whole is incredible. You're making a difference too - it's amazing. Keep it up, friend.\" [S23T11][S23T12]. Dave thanked Calvin — his support \"really helps,\" it's \"great to have a friend who believes in me,\" and he'll \"keep pushing\" [S23T13]; Calvin: \"I believe in you, Dave. Keep pushing and never forget how awesome you are.\" [S23T14]; Dave: \"Your support means a lot. I'm gonna keep going and not forget my value!\" [S23T15]. Calvin closed the chat urging Dave to \"keep going for those dreams. You got this!\" and announced, \"Last week\" (~2023-10-09/15), he got a new Ferrari — \"a masterpiece on wheels\" — and is excited for \"thrilling rides and unforgettable journeys,\" sharing a photo of it (a black sports car parked in front of a building) — \"Perhaps a photo of this unique beauty will lift your mood.\" (details in ## New luxury car (Ferrari, 2023-03-26)) [S23T16]. The 2023-10-15 conversation then closed: Dave congratulated Calvin on the new Ferrari (\"that's incredible! Must be one amazing ride\"), said Calvin's positivity is contagious, and asked him to \"share a pic of your new beauty whenever you're ready\" and to \"keep the good vibes rolling\"; Calvin agreed the Ferrari \"is indeed a showstopper\" and said he'd \"share a pic soon,\" and the two signed off \"Here's to more thrilling rides and positive vibes... looking forward to catching up soon!\" [S23T17][S23T18].","text_sha256":"08347bf7c3c2dbc6825ba89d206eacaf0a2254af1fb1e03a8c94ac2eeb8c0732","timestamp":"2023-10-15T09:39:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D2:1","D2:3","D2:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":29,"line_start":29,"source_locators":["[S2T1]","[S2T3]","[S2T5]"],"text_sha256":"efc5e90f862cd6d1485b41f56e6f79b456d86152d216cdbf084523c005b78536"},{"dia_ids":["D2:3","D2:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":30,"line_start":30,"source_locators":["[S2T3]","[S2T7]"],"text_sha256":"1603a95c5b44d78274afc76259a7f4f534336f2f9081f69e181e8e439432732c"},{"dia_ids":["D2:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":31,"line_start":31,"source_locators":["[S2T5]"],"text_sha256":"f4c27fe5fdd90dbc060b88c99e5fd12fd04b2aa7803117795aadd75029376304"},{"dia_ids":["D2:4"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":32,"line_start":32,"source_locators":["[S2T4]"],"text_sha256":"55df18300dbc4b9882c0da1370f8a1b7fc3a06903735dc0bb1cabc8116633ec1"},{"dia_ids":["D3:13","D3:14"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":33,"line_start":33,"source_locators":["[S3T13]","[S3T14]"],"text_sha256":"7c04e6a6e02833422667d11974f2284e6c5e43a081b9885537d0dfe2fc1cc9